WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,700
I heard the abbot of the Miaofa Department say a while ago that the Hard Family might have been robbed of their luck.

2
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:12,890
That kid from Yinwu Hospital ended up like this

3
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:16,890
It's so terrifying that there is such evil forgiveness.

4
00:00:16,890 --> 00:00:21,050
No wonder my family is so tough. I'm afraid my luck has been taken away.

5
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:23,500
Is there no way to solve it?

6
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:27,500
It’s best to let the person who borrows luck suffer a hundred times a thousand times of backlash, so that you can relieve your anger.

7
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,500
Grandma, I want to go to Myohoji

8
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:32,500
I want to make a wish with Bodhisattva

9
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:34,940
What wish does Jiaojiao want to make?

10
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:38,940
I hope my grandparents will be safe and live to be a hundred years old

11
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:42,940
Okay, we'll go to Miaofa Division tomorrow.

12
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:49,940
Yoyo misses you Yoyo misses you Yoyo

13
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:52,940
People Cats never miss anyone

14
00:00:52,940 --> 00:00:55,940
This cat has a bad temper and almost scratched the doctor

15
00:00:55,940 --> 00:00:57,940
But I sent your photo to Dr. Shou

16
00:00:57,940 --> 00:00:59,940
She obediently cooperated with the injection.

17
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:03,870
Damn humans, don’t let this temple’s secrets be exposed

18
00:01:05,770 --> 00:01:08,630
I knew Mimi missed me

19
00:01:08,630 --> 00:01:09,630
Are you ready to adopt her?

20
00:01:09,630 --> 00:01:13,340
Mimi, can you be my family?

21
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:17,450
She's talking about family

22
00:01:17,450 --> 00:01:21,450
In this life of humans and cats, they are not as dissolute as they love freedom.

23
00:01:21,450 --> 00:01:23,450
The cat will continue to wander

24
00:01:23,450 --> 00:01:25,450
Can’t you go home and eat after wandering?

25
00:01:25,450 --> 00:01:31,070
I declare that you are Yoyo’s family
